; "its" — singular possessive pronoun, third person
; signals: the most recently established entity owns the following concept
; its IS naama-pratibodha expressed as an English pronoun
; example: "a ball has mass 5 kg. find ITS kinetic energy."
; → [its, naama-pratibodha, ball]
; → [kinetic-energy, shashthi-vibhakti, ball]  (derived from reference)

(bhasha pronoun-its
  (swarupa avyaya)
  (sthita english naama-pratibodha eka-vachana))
